write requests. It MUST NOT start or cancel a remote task. A late response from an
earlier observation generation MUST NOT publish results, outcomes or callbacks after
stop or resume, even when the final source and head match. Source: Tavi's accepted
21 Oct 2026 shared iOS lifecycle plan and shared-review-detach-keeps-server-work.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;security] shared-review-resume-reconciles-before-observation
Scene resume MUST be idempotent and refresh the actual opening, saved results and
authoritative task list before restarting polls from their returned revisions.
Interrupted reconciliation MUST keep known content and drafts and retry with capped,
cancellable backoff; it MUST NOT invent a task outcome. A task observed before stop
MUST settle at most once after its authoritative terminal state and saved results
are reconciled. A fresh session MUST read existing server work without replaying its
start or announcing historical terminal work. Source: Tavi's accepted 21 Oct 2026
shared iOS lifecycle plan, retaining server-owned Standard/Deep follow-up passes.

