AI/error-recovery journey and the accepted 22 Oct 2026 Tour Stop rejection finding.
Only the latest actually dispatched explicit Stop for a still-running task MAY
publish a rejection; a queued tap that never dispatches MUST NOT supersede an accepted
receipt. Source: the accepted 22 Oct 2026 full Stop receipt-ordering review, finding 1.

